Warrant</B>&#8221; means one warrant to acquire one (1) Ordinary Share at an exercise price of $11.50 per share;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#8220;<B>Scheme</B>&#8221;
means the scheme of arrangement under part 5.1 of the Corporations Act substantially in the form set out Annexure 1, or in such other
form as is agreed between Lionheart and Security Matters Limited, together with any amendment or modification made pursuant to section
