    </FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 2%">&#160;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 60%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">SMX
    (Security Matters) Public Limited Company </FONT></TD></TR>

