    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Represents
    payables to settle the actual transaction costs of $17,344M in connection with the Transactions, of which, as of December 31, 2022,
    $7,716M have been incurred and $3,157M also recognised as deferred asset. Since Lionheart&#8217;s pro-forma net assets are at negative
