    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Represents
    the warrants in the Parent forming part of Lionheart&#8217;s net assets. The warrants are derivative financial liabilities in accordance
    with IFRS. The fair value is the market price of $0.12 at Closing. As reflected from the Business Combination Agreement, the Parent&#8217;s
    warrants have the same fair value as Lionheart&#8217;s warrants prior to Closing.</FONT></TD></TR>
