                                            </FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">years;
                                            and (4) expected dividend yield: <FONT >0</FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">%.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

