<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">3.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">As
                                            of December 31, 2022, the Group has estimated carry forward tax losses of approximately <FONT >24,106
                                            </FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">(2021:
                                            <FONT >17,659
                                            </FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">2020:<FONT >13,151</FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">)
                                            which may be carried forward and offset against taxable income for an indefinite period in
