<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0.55pt 0pt 0.5pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
ultimate legal parent entity of the Group is Security Matters Limited, incorporated and domiciled in Australia. The consolidated financial
statements incorporate the assets, liabilities and results of the following subsidiaries in accordance with the accounting policies described
